# Backend Conventions

Follow `.ai/architecture/backend.md`, `.ai/architecture/database.md`, `.ai/architecture/authentication.md`, and `.ai/architecture/security.md`.

## Module shape

`controller → service → repository` with module-owned DTOs and tests.

## Musts

- class-validator DTOs + ValidationPipe whitelist
- RBAC permission checks on every protected route
- Argon2 for passwords; JWT + rotating refresh tokens
- BullMQ for notifications, exports, content-release fan-out
- `@nestjs/schedule` for drip unlock; unlock relative to enrollment
- Pino logging; Swagger for public API docs
- Paginate lists; avoid N+1; use transactions for multi-step writes

See owning docs in `.ai/modules/` for domain rules.
